OL,3,ATrump administration illegally fired
OL,4,AJames Comey's daughter, judge rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US justice department illegally
OL,7,Ffired Maurene Comey, the daughter of
OL,8,Fformer Federal Bureau of Investigation
OL,9,F(FBI) director James Comey, a federal
OL,10,Fjudge has ruled.
OL,12,FComey, who lost her job as a federal
OL,13,Fprosecutor in New York in July 2025,
OL,14,Fsued the government, arguing she was
OL,15,Funlawfully fired because of her father,
OL,16,Fa critic of US President Donald Trump,
OL,17,Fand because of her perceived political
OL,18,Faffiliations.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
