OL,3,ATrump administration illegally fired
OL,4,AJames Comey's daughter, judge rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Jesse Furman ruled on Monday that
OL,7,Fthe Trump administration must reinstate
OL,8,Fher and that she must be given back
OL,9,Fpay.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the justice
OL,12,Fdepartment said in a statement that it
OL,13,Fdisagreed with the decision and "will
OL,14,Fappeal in due course".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
